cff-version: 1.2.0
title: TDC-Studio
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: brightonmoon
repository-code: "https://github.com/brightonmoon/tdc-studio"
abstract: >
  Modular MLOps studio for ADMET property prediction using the Therapeutics Data
  Commons (TDC) benchmark suite. Implements D-MPNN, Multi-Task Learning ensembles,
  Optuna hyperparameter optimization, Weights & Biases experiment tracking,
  Google Colab GPU orchestration, and FastAPI model serving.
keywords:
  - admet
  - drug-discovery
  - therapeutics-data-commons
  - cheminformatics
  - graph-neural-network
  - multi-task-learning
  - mlops
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-22"
